Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:07.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,被神威大典不可思议的力量所指引
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:07.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(685,960)}Majesty Chronicon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:10.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来到了过去的蓝天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:10.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1230,960)}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不 从今天起我就是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.11,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}高尚愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.57,0:00:27.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在战斗结束前 要藏好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:30.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去Cure Noble那里吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:31.62,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:39.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:42.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝·暗塌谷...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:45.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是女帝的爸爸...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:49.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.75,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:02.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·破晓终结
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:02.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Magic Hours End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:02.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}无用的小知识：这里的hours有歧义，也能理解成ours和awards。\N去掉八竿子打不着的ours，译作"魔法断罪"也挺霸气的。\N不过考虑magic hour是指日出前和日落后，一天里天空颜色变化最多最快的时间段\N有的朋友大概已经冒出"逢魔"二字了，不过大家看后面的剧情就能明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,又来碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:17.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,袭击没有罪过的嘟嘟鸟族的村庄...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:19.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量才是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:22.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,所以弱小便是罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:26.14,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,如若我说 你的理解有悖常识
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:30.42,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,力量并非一切 陛下又当如何应对？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 Cure Noble
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:46.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要去公主的城市？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.43,0:01:50.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家正在齐心协力 重建城市
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:54.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,热烈欢迎哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}暗塌谷帝国的善良少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.55,0:03:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你教会了我很多很多...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 学到的知识越多 我就越是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量真的是一切吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:54.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,对从诞生自这暗塌谷能量海中... 诞生自最强力量的我们而言
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这是无可争辩的真理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:01.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量便是一切
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里也被破坏得一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 有点难以置信...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:18.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘟嘟鸟们！你们来了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前几日承蒙关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好香啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免费的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的家被破坏了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧 这姑娘烤的面包 好吃到打耳光都不肯放的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻... 要哪一种？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难办啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:45.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个麻烦你处理了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:49.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:55.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:05:00.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿哒哒哒哒哒哒...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:12.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:14.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇 快住手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争只会催生出眼泪！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:34.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量既一切 力量才是一切啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:42.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,保不准哪一天 蓝天大地会开一个通道 攻打进这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:44.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量就是为了防患于未然！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你是余宝贵的女儿...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.15,0:05:52.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝国的皇女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:54.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,必须要变得更强！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 那边那谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说你呢 就是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我们下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在上面搞麻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我有事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哦 哦 哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小妹妹 戴的首饰不错哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有那精致的衣裳...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是有钱人是吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大哥 大哥 大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这丫头在叹气啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我们有意见吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看清楚了！现在的时代力量才是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:40.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别... 别误会...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是在助人为乐...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:57.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,想要进城避难的人 我们来者不拒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:00.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 也会有像他们那样的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:01.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,你受惊了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量是一切... 才是正确的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:18.98,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,因为战争只会催生出眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天泪公主 我有重要的事要跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:34.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 你遇到了女帝...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:40.73,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 她跟我说"希望结束这场战争"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:42.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女帝会这么说...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,和我们所认识的 简直判若两人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.54,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,她是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:51.84,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,“我绝对会说服父亲的”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:57.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,"可是 他认为要是输的话 自己就会国破人亡"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,“所以 希望我们能够宽恕皇帝”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:05.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,“也希望你停止战争”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:11.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能够... 相信她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:14.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意相信她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:18.22,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,无信任 无改变
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:26.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也愿意相信 相信女帝的天泪公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:28.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你前来赴约 天泪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:04.03,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,能说服令尊 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:08.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,能够迎来与贵国和解这一刻...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.77,0:09:11.47,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,甚是令我欢喜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:14.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要确认一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:18.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有想过 这次是余引诱你出面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:25.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,而余的部下 此刻正在奇袭都城的调虎离山之计？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:30.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:36.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你还想要终结战争... 还敢口出狂言 说要宽恕余吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:52.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:56.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,回答余 能否宽恕余！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:14.29,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:17.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,没错！这就是力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴 乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命 Cure Noble！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:29.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正正正... 正是因为身处力量才是一切的这个时代
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,善良才是最宝贵的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的和做的完全相反啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:54.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:59.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你这只会欺负弱小的胆小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:00.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有种就过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:03.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:13.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼啊 你过来！跟着拍手声来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:29.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:31.24,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大成功！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（轰鸣声）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:39.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看来对话不是太顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:42.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在天泪公主回来前...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:45.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我们亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.64,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇！Cure Noble！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:06.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,消失吧 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:25.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,余现在就证明给你看 力量才是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:53.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,光美
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:53.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,破晓终结
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Magic Hours End
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:09.86,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:11.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:14.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:16.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了... 像我这种弱者 也保护了父皇...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下 父皇是不是明白了 力量并非一切...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:37.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女儿啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:41.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我都做了什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅... 我父皇...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:56.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝 能用你的力量缝合伤口吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:59.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量没有这种功能...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:05.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不！能够办到的 现在的你是能办到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:12.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:21.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？难不成...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了... 突然就...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:28.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这力量居然还有这种用法...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:49.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 我犯下了罪过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:56.01,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,被愤怒冲昏了头脑 忘记了战争只会催生出眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 是一位少女...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:05.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,是这位女帝·暗塌谷 让我们重新睁开了眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:11.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,是她的善良 终结了这场战争
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:28.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,在这夜日交替之际 在这美丽的瞬间！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:32.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地与暗塌谷帝国 缔结和平条约！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（欢呼声）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:16:01.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,数以千计的乱暴兽会出现在城里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,城市在一瞬间就会被摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:05.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:14.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在这夜日交替之际 在这美丽的瞬间！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这句话...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:24.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是你终结了蓝天大地与暗塌谷帝国的战争...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:25.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:29.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！是什么改变了你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:31.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在说什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:32.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们见证了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:39.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典引导我们 见证了300年前的真相
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:43.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们见到了传说中的Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,攻城先放一边...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:55.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你们现在就闭嘴 消失在我的面前！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
