Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:35.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:39.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就不闭！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.49,0:20:40.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:44.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不交流不交心！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:46.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,被愤怒冲昏头脑互相斗争！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:52.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这种... 这种战争只会催生出眼泪啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:57.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,说得你很懂似的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:01.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:03.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:13.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,300年前的伤口裂开了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:16.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我无所谓！你一个人逃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:18.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:22.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,保护你 是我的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:41.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:46.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝为什么会改变呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.23,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再尝试跟她交流
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:56.38,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的话 就再下次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.99,0:22:00.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:09.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Butterfly哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:09.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}蝴蝶愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.97,0:22:12.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 一起飞扬跳起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:49.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的人们都无精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.28,0:23:51.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮他们换换心情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.64,0:23:52.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,开派对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:55.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 今天可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:56.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诞圣节！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:56.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诞圣节！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.76,0:23:58.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诞圣节？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.76,0:23:58.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诞圣节？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:01.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:01.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄们的圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:57.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:03.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:08.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:16.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:21.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:31.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:36.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:38.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:42.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:46.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:50.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:50.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:52.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:57.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:02.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:07.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:12.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:15.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:23.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
